# List Examples

# Create a list
Set numbers to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5].
print numbers.

# Access list items
Set first to item 2 of numbers.
Set second to item 1 of numbers.
print first.
print second.

# Append to list
Add "hello" to numbers.
print numbers.

# List with mixed types
Set mixed to [1, "hello", true, 42].
Set num to item 0 of mixed.
Set str to item 1 of mixed.
Set bool to item 2 of mixed.
print num.
print str.
print bool.

# Empty list
Set empty to [].
print empty.

